  "label": "Racist Meme Tropes",
  "description": "The meme format uses a common racist trope of juxtaposing Black people with prison imagery to imply criminality and devalue their lives. This trope is part of a broader pattern of racially charged internet memes that use visual and textual elements to spread hate and misinformation, requiring knowledge of internet culture and racialized humor to understand its impact.",
